    metadata: {"notes": "F8.1B bounded shell-born cohort fixture: two ballistic launch shells die at 2/4 seconds; generic OnDeath links birth stars and 32 smoke puffs each into one 96-slot pool. Representative flashes bind accepted child-star OnSpawn; moving lights follow child stars. No independent smoke/stars emission or host injection. Lit seeded billow material shared with F8.1A; tails overlap/drift/drain by 18 seconds. Only smoke supplies visible pixels; schema-required launch sprite markers have zero opacity. No cross-draw, full-show cost, natural-smoke art or AAA/finale acceptance. Host scale 0.1."},
